{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/j20g6r","slideIndex":11,"text":"本项目实际使用MuJoCo与Mink。Mobile ALOHA、Open-TeleVision作为相关工作与任务设计参考，未复现其模仿学习训练或真实机器人性能。\n参考文献：\nFu, Z., Zhao, T. Z., Finn, C. Mobile ALOHA: Learning Bimanual Mobile Manipulation with Low-Cost Whole-Body Teleoperation. 2024. https://arxiv.org/abs/2401.02117\nCheng, X., Li, J., Yang, S., Yang, G., Wang, X. Open-TeleVision: Teleoperation with Immersive Active Visual Feedback. 2024. https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.01512\nMink: https://github.com/kevinzakka/mink\nMuJoCo: https://mujoco.readthedocs.io/en/stable/overview.html\n前两篇论文题名、作者、年份已于2026年11月16日核对原始arXiv页面；本页不引用其性能数字作为本项目结果。"}